                        "review": "My daughter loved it - fast and furious and lot's of different background settings - the babies cry, and then they laugh, and then I bounced them off the road and they cry - at times it's like a baby massacre. Nice, bright and colourful - reminds me of Lego to look at. Nice safe game for kids to play and adults like me, and it ain't early access either!\n\nDanial",
